      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im a freelance designer and im trying to organize my quickbooks for the year. i just bought a really expensive ergonomic office chair for my home studio. do i categorize that as a business expense or is it a personal draw? i want to make sure i dont mess up my deductions.",
