      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The occasional personal use does not typically disqualify it from being a business expense, but you should track the percentage of business use for accurate reporting. For smaller supplies, keep a running log of purchases and monitor your inventory periodically to catch discrepancies early. Don't worry too much; minor losses are common, but diligent tracking of *purchases* is your best defense during an audit.",
